often they hold, some will not, some engulfed are FO, most of the time I still can't figure out why. They are a powerful tool but need to understand whats behind them.\n\nAny comments, suggestions, advice are welcome.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#304","p":13,"im":["178d477e5a9f728019d102c0be2a4f50a52567ee","23ec5b77b9d7f4cf544cb48c9e15ed4ee3f3ff32","6d4a11410842bf49a75e76d9b0610ca3c4052fae","49396c0e77e7a851ec0c6c8f81198c6f7310b0d8","f63d4a6fed2866a4eeee562d3f0db815ef626b00","05b59c7403e71a523de783211b3410f05235692c","3a0aa726e044afc856163c0b6bf59dceeb66884f"],"m":304},{"id":"flaglimits_p13_305","t":"Aaron\n\nHi guys,\n\nReally enjoying the hard word being done here, keep it up!\n\nSharky I have a few comments, this is only my view mate, it may give you something to think about before the seniors comment:\n\n1707\n\nSharky your FL is really good, keep it up\n\nAndy, really liking your FL work mate:\n\nCheers guys\n\nDT","a":"—","d":"","n":"#305","p":13,"im":["dfbf07eb21982cca99eb5641a759f72cde5ac017","5096f690260aef93142875ca6400fcc8304fa97a","620bf5b30386f0188e9212735385e7fad988e328"],"m":305},{"id":"flaglimits_p13_306","t":"Andyfx\n\nGood point DT, that 's a nice new DP (supply pocket) formed to look for short after Engulf, I added some note on that chart and others things I noticed on previous charts\n\nAlso Engulf of previous Low, price would have eventually bounced at one of those 2 Supply pockets but care for FO into FL Supply Zone.\n\nSome more note on previous charts, missed that there is a bigger FL in that place.\n\nTiny Local FL, small pip range, but nice PA.\n\nOne failed FL on H1 Gold, one with weak reaction on the right, then Engulf, and FTR to source.\n\nZoom to M30 to see that SR Flip of previous chart, but can't define a clear FL.","a":"—","d":"","n":"#306","p":13,"im":["440b1ada37e184fe330ef178710463aba827e4ad","164a93abf5619722c133ca2206b11fd597d097eb","6749cd4b6d46a4b31a5a1701135f3f7fb68440a1","514e301d31910c98b9d67617295164fef61d9257","7695014080af0ca8